[7.764, "o", "--- draft 1:\r\nCan I send a 150 Wh power bank with Kestrel, and what happens if my parcel is lost?\r\n\r\nNo. Kestrel does not carry lithium batteries above 100 Wh, so a 150 Wh power bank cannot be shipped. If your parcel is lost (incident code KX-2), you will receive a full refund of the delivery fee plus a €15 voucher. Refunds are issued automatically within 5 busin"]
[7.764, "o", "ess days.\r\n\r\nCritic approved.\r\n"]
